          "description": "The bounds check uses `Store::len`, which returns the configured capacity rather than the number of records present. For a partially filled store - capacity 100 holding 3 records - any index in 3..100 passes the guard and reaches `store.record_at(index)`, which indexes the backing `Vec` directly and panics. The guard should compare against `Store::filled`."
        }
